 personas con discapacidad</b></li><li><b>Wi-Fi</b></li><li><b>Citas fuera de horario</b><span>Con Hollywood y Patrick ($70+)</span></li></ul></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"gallery\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Galería</p><h2>Desde la barbería</h2></div><div class=\"gallery\"><figure><img src=\"images/taper.jpg\" alt=\"Taper fade, vista lateral\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/design-cut.jpg\" alt=\"Diseño libre en el pelo\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/skin-fade.jpg\" alt=\"Skin fade con raya marcada\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/beard-lineup.jpg\" alt=\"Delineado de barba en la barbería\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/afro-cut.jpg\" alt=\"Afro con forma y delineado\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/fade-side.jpg\" alt=\"Low fade, de perfil\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/fade-pair.jpg\" alt=\"Dos fades recién hechos\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/chair.jpg\" alt=\"Silla de barbero en Final Kuts\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></div></div></section>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"reviews\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Reseñas</p><h2>Lo que dicen nuestros clientes</h2></div><div class=\"ratings\"><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">5.0</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Google</b> · 227 reseñas</div><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Final+Kuts+Barbershop/@38.3559069,-121.9891209,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80853d0d426bd07d:0x6bc0dff565469c5b!8m2!3d38.3559069!4d-121.9891209!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Lee más reseñas en Google →</a></div></div><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">4.9</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Booksy</b> · 401 reseñas</div><a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/384088_final-kuts_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Lee más reseñas en Booksy →</a></div></div></div><div class=\"reviews\"><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Best spot in town, hands down. No matter who you get, they&#39;re all great &amp; always take care of everyone that walks through the door. The atmosphere is lively &amp; the conversations are entertaining. I highly recommend everyone to check out Final Kuts.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Final%20Kuts%20Barbershop%20348%20Merchant%20St%20Ste%20A%20Vacaville%20CA%2095688\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Dec 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Paul is professional, reliable and his shop is pleasant and very clean. He does an excellent job on my hair!!!!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Andrea · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/196333_hollywood-the-barber_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · Oct 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“My son doesn’t like getting haircuts and Patrick was very patient and understanding. The shop is clean and always good vibes when we visit.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Final%20Kuts%20Barbershop%20348%20Merchant%20St%20Ste%20A%20Vacaville%20CA%2095688\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Feb 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Great experience. My third time going in for a cut with Mare. Friendly, professional and attentive. I am very happy with the cut. Everyone in the shop is very friendly. Great place for a cut and shave. I recommend.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Rick · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/1366045_marethebarber_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · Aug 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Amare took our walk-in for my 1year old son’s mullet haircut and not only perfected exactly what I wanted, but also did it in a timely manner which is critically important when cutting a child’s hair! I’m very pleased! I think I’ve found my son’s barber!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Final%20Kuts%20Barbershop%20348%20Merchant%20St%20Ste%20A%20Vacaville%20CA%2095688\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Nov 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Great service Luis is an exceptional barber who pays attention to detail. I left feeling confident highly recommend”</blockquote><figcaption>— Peezy · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/1711890_luis_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · Aug 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Andrew is an exceptional barber! He listened to what we needed and cut my son&#39;s hair perfectly- crisp and clean. The barbershop is friendly, comfortable professional and close to places to have a bite while you wait for someone.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Final%20Kuts%20Barbershop%20348%20Merchant%20St%20Ste%20A%20Vacaville%20CA%2095688\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Nov 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Patrick is excellent! Super friendly and chill environment”</blockquote><figcaption>— Vincent · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/593397_patrick_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · Sep 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“This is a great barber shop, friendly professional and great cuts. Great for walk ins..”</blockquote><figcaption>— Johnny C. · Yelp</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Great atmosphere. My son got a regular hair cut from Paul. He was very attentive, asking questions to ensure he got what he wanted.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Arminthia S. · Yelp</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"faq\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Preguntas frecuentes</p><h2>Tus preguntas, respondidas</h2></div><div class=\"faq\"><details><summary>¿Puedo llegar sin cita?</summary><p>¡Sí! Se atiende sin cita, y hasta hemos hecho cortes sin cita a niños de 1 año. Para no esperar, reserva con tu barbero en línea.</p></details><details><summary>¿Cómo reservo con un barbero en particular?</summary><p>Cada uno tiene su propia página de reservas: Hollywood The Barber, Patrick, Marethebarber y Luis. Solo toca los botones de Reservar de arriba.</p></details><details><summary>¿Cuánto cuesta un corte?</summary><p>Un corte estándar de hombre cuesta $40–$45, según el barbero. Toca el botón de Reservar de tu barbero para ver los precios actuales.</p></details><details><summary>¿Le cortan el pelo a niños?</summary><p>¡Sí! Los cortes para niños cuestan $35–$50. Mare atiende a niños de 8 años en adelante, y los cortes para menores de 6 de Hollywood no están disponibles de jueves a sábado.</p></details><details><summary>¿Hacen cortes fuera de horario?</summary><p>Sí. Hollywood hace cortes fuera de horario desde $70, y Patrick hace cortes antes o después del horario por $70.</p></details><details><summary>¿Aceptan tarjetas?</summary><p>Patrick acepta tarjetas de crédito. Para los demás barberos, llámanos al (707) 685-9136 para confirmar.</p></details><details><summary>¿Cuál es el horario?</summary><p>Abrimos lun de 10 AM a 6 PM, mar a vie de 10 AM a 7 PM y sáb de 9 AM a 6 PM; cerramos el domingo. El horario puede variar un poco, así que reserva en línea o llama.</p></details></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section visit\" id=\"visit\">\n  <div class=\"wrap visit-grid\">\n    <div class=\"visit-info\">\n      <p class=\"kicker\">Visítanos</p>\n      <h2>Horario y ubicación</h2>\n      <address>348 Merchant St Ste A<br>Vacaville, CA 95688</address>\n      <p><a class=\"phone-link\" href=\"tel:+17076859136\">(707) 685-9136</a></p>\n      <table class=\"hours\" id=\"hoursTable\"><tr data-d=\"1\"><td>Lunes</td><td>10 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"2\"><td>Martes</td><td>10 AM – 7 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"3\"><td>Miércoles</td><td>10 AM – 7 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"4\"><td>Jueves</td><td>10 AM – 7 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"5\"><td>Viernes</td><td>10 AM – 7 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"6\"><td>Sábado</td><td>9 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"0\"><td>Domingo</td><td>Cerrado</td></tr></table>\n      <p class=\"note\">El horario puede variar un poco, así que reserva en línea o llama para confirmar.</p>\n      <div class=\"socials\"><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/final_kuts/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 2h10a5 5 0 0 1 5 5v10a5 5 0 0 1-5 5H7a5 5 0 0 1-5-5V7a5 5 0 0 1 5-5zm5 5a5 5 0 1 0 0 10 5 5 0 0 0 0-10zm0 2a3 3 0 1 1 0 6 3 3 0 0 1 0-6zm5.5-3a1.5 1.5 0 1 0 0 3 1.5 1.5 0 0 0 0-3z\"/></svg><span>@final_kuts</span></a><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/1090522654670466\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 8h3V4h-3a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2H8v4h2v8h4v-8h3l1-4h-4V8z\"/></svg><span>Facebook</span></a><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/384088_final-kuts_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 2v2H5a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-2V2h-2v2H9V2H7zm-2 8h14v10H5V10z\"/></sv